# Fitted posteriors and the per-model feature metadata beside them: build
# outputs, and the metadata is not usable without the .nc files it describes.
# Only the manifest is kept — seasons, configuration, diagnostics and the
# round-trip result are what tie a published projection to the fit that made it.
artifacts/**
!artifacts/**/
!artifacts/*/manifest.json
# The trained league agent is the exception: sixteen numbers plus the
# standardisation they are defined against, self-contained, and forty-five
# minutes of search to regenerate. Nothing about it needs a .nc file.
!artifacts/league_agent.json
